The shown frame's grade, each 1 as the game draws it: gamma (0.5 to 2, 1.2 by default; brightness before) lifts the
midtones, black and white staying; contrast (0.5 to 2, 1.1 by default) is an S-curve of the luma about mid grey, black
and white and the hue staying; saturation (0 to 2, 1.5 by default) mixes each pixel with its luma. Settings, applied by
the present's blit after the game's gamma ramp to everything the game draws, menus and HUD too (not the runtime's own
ImGui, drawn after it).

